<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-MADRID RIVALS MEET IN SEASON OPENER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MADRID RIVALS MEET IN SEASON OPENER.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish champions Real Madrid will host local rivals Atletico in the opening match of the new Spanish league season next month, the Spanish football federation announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The game will take place over the August 30-31 weekend. Atletico Madrid were 1996 champions.</p>
